<title>FRANCE: BIC boosted by sales rise.</title>
<headline>BIC boosted by sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in BIC were up sharply on Friday on the back of an 11 percent increase in third quarter sales and a small acquisition in Germany, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1020 GMT, BIC was up 4.56 percent at 734 francs.</p>
<p>BIC reported a 11 percent rise in third quarter sales to 1.737 billion francs. The nine month figure was up six percent to 4.929 billion.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
